{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Classic Mazes Featured In This Demo.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo features the first 2 classic mazes of They Watch: Hedge Maze and Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where Am I?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/extras/c906c777d53a874e9ddbc6472b4ce3a5.poster.avif?t=1758635900\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/extras/c906c777d53a874e9ddbc6472b4ce3a5.webm?t=1758635900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the demo of They Watch.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find The Runestones.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/extras/61be4fc66ce33ca71086807485f8daf0.poster.avif?t=1758635900\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/extras/61be4fc66ce33ca71086807485f8daf0.webm?t=1758635900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The portal is your only way out and its runestones have been scattered across the mazes. Find all of the runestones, but don't let the entities who guard the runestones find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Little Extra Help.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/extras/5ef6c09862dd80938451985cda7c398e.poster.avif?t=1758635900\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/extras/5ef6c09862dd80938451985cda7c398e.webm?t=1758635900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/extras/5ef6c09862dd80938451985cda7c398e.mp4?t=1758635900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not entirely alone\u2014you have your mysterious but trusty wrist device with multiple functions: it features a radar which you can use to locate runestones, a tracker which tells you how many runestones are left, a GPS arrow which always points back towards the portal, and, for some unknown reason, you receive occasional messages. From who? No one knows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4041170?t=1758635900","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4041170?t=1758635900","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/57d125a71c5cffef0e8819c6bef87aea4049a439/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758635900","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/57d125a71c5cffef0e8819c6bef87aea4049a439/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758635900","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Classic Mazes Featured In This Demo.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo features the first 2 classic mazes of They Watch: Hedge Maze and Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where Am I?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/extras/c906c777d53a874e9ddbc6472b4ce3a5.poster.avif?t=1758635900\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/extras/c906c777d53a874e9ddbc6472b4ce3a5.webm?t=1758635900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the demo of They Watch.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find The Runestones.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/extras/61be4fc66ce33ca71086807485f8daf0.poster.avif?t=1758635900\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/extras/61be4fc66ce33ca71086807485f8daf0.webm?t=1758635900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The portal is your only way out and its runestones have been scattered across the mazes. Find all of the runestones, but don't let the entities who guard the runestones find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Little Extra Help.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/extras/5ef6c09862dd80938451985cda7c398e.poster.avif?t=1758635900\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/extras/5ef6c09862dd80938451985cda7c398e.webm?t=1758635900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/extras/5ef6c09862dd80938451985cda7c398e.mp4?t=1758635900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not entirely alone\u2014you have your mysterious but trusty wrist device with multiple functions: it features a radar which you can use to locate runestones, a tracker which tells you how many runestones are left, a GPS arrow which always points back towards the portal, and, for some unknown reason, you receive occasional messages. From who? No one knows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p>","developers":["CCGS"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3879000","name":"They Watch"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041170/3ff6fe9dc72b1a304cb3826553fa411860976d67/header.jpg?t=1758635900","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4041170/531032673/72720d2712f4545ca73e3ac19e953027c7522ba2/1758422176/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758468107","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4041170/531032673/72720d2712f4545ca73e3ac19e953027c7522ba2/1758422176/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758468107","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4041170/531032673/72720d2712f4545ca73e3ac19e953027c7522ba2/1758422176/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758468107","id":257198980,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers